 <h3><u>QAYAAL E QAALIQ E AKBAR</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p dir=ltr>Qayaal e qaaliq e Akbar ka ham qayaal Husain,<br> Jisey zawaal nahi hai WO laa zawaal husain,<br> Bashar ki roop me Allah ki misaal Husain,<br> Dil e rasool ki dhadkan ali ka laal Husain,</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Husain jaisey kisii Ke bhi waaledain nahi,<br> Bohat haseen hai Yousuf Magar Husain nahi.</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>1) samandaron ney kiyaa jiski naukari ko salaam,<br> Namaaz karti rahi jis ki bandagii ko salaam,<br> Kiyaa hai maut ney qudd jis ki zindagi ko salaam,<br> Zamaana karta hai ab tak usee jarii ko salaam,</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Hayaat maut Ke saayil ko baat Deta hai,<br> Husain teg ko sheh rag se kaat Deta hai.</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>2) ye kaayenaat riyaasat rayees hai Shabbir,<br> Dabeer e ishq e qudaa ka Anees hai Shabbir,<br> Nafas nafas ki sadaa hai Nafees hai Shabbir,<br> Qasam habeeb ki qismat nawees hai Shabbir,</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Qudaa Ke lehjey me aksar kalaam kartey hai,<br> Husain hurr ko alaihissalam kartey hai.</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>3) Husain sabr hai eesaar hai mohabbat hai,<br> Husain ishq ki mazmoon ki ibaarat hai,<br> Husain rehmatulillaalamii pey rehmat hai,<br> Husain koi fasaana nahi haqeeqat hai,</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Jahaa&nbsp; me ab bhi shahe mashraqain baaqi hai,<br> Yazeed mitgaya naa e Husain baaqi hai.</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>4) diyaa bujhaake Jo raushan karey zameer e Bashar,<br> Jo kaayenaat me rakhta hai hurshiñaa si nazar<br> Jo chashm e gaiz se kardey jahaa ko zero o zabr,<br> Husain zaakir e maabood hai tah e qanjar,</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Kamaal e azm e mohammad dikhaàdiya jisney,<br> Sageer betey ko GAAZI banaadiya jisney.</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>5) kahii tabassum e asgar kahi Hasan hai Husain,<br> Kahii pey GAAZI kahi aks e panjatan hai Husain,<br> Kahi akela kahii qudd me anjuman hai Husain,<br> Misaal e haider e karrar saf shikan hai Husain,</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Har ek muhaaz pey gaalib dikhaayi deta hai,<br> Husain to abutalib&nbsp; Deta hai.</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>6) Husain qaaliq e qaaq e shifaa maseeha bhi,<br> Husain faiz ka daryaa hai aur pyaasa bhi,<br> Husain Mazhar e Rabb hai qudaa&nbsp; ka banda bhi,<br> Husain laakho pey bhaari rahaa akela bhi,</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Husain ne abutalib ki jaanashii ki tarha,<br> Ulatke rakhdiyaa maidaan aastee ki tarha.</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>7) gareeb aisa Ke gurbat nisaar&nbsp; ho jis par,<br> Shaheed aisa shahaadat nisaar ho jis par,<br> Zaheen paida zihaanat nisaar ho jis par,<br> Imam aisa imamat nisaar ho jis par,</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Nizaam e deen o shariyyat ki laaj rakhta hai,<br> Husain ab bhi qudaa ka mizaaj rakhta hai.</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>8) anaa parast gareebo ka chaarasaaz husain,<br> Wiqar e Aal e Mohammad nabi ka naaz husain,<br> Qasam qudaa ki qudaa honey ka Jawab husain,<br> Kaho ye meer takallum meri namaaz husain,</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Nabi se poochlo kya martabaa Husain ka hai,<br> Ye kaayenaat qudaa ki qudaa husain ka hai.</p> 
